+/// `character.reweight_robe` gives a named family up to eight chains,
+/// `robe_<sector>_0` under Hips down to `robe_<sector>_3`, one per 45° sector
+/// (f, fl, l, bl, b, br, r, fr — +X is the figure's LEFT), and skins the
